{"t":"OKLO","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Oklo Inc.","ko":"오클로","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","employees":215,"hq":"Santa Clara, CA, United States","website":"https://www.oklo.com","summary_en":"Oklo Inc. develops fission power plants to provide energy at scale to customers in the United States. The company offers Aurora Powerhouse, which is designed to produce between 15 and up to 75 megawatts of electricity. It is also commercializing nuclear fuel recycling and fuel fabrication technology that can convert used nuclear fuel into usable fuel for its reactors. The company was formerly known as AltC Acquisition Corp. and changed its name to Oklo Inc. in May 2024. Oklo Inc. was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Oklo Inc.는 미국 고객에게 대규모 에너지를 제공하기 위해 핵분열 발전소를 개발합니다. 이 회사는 15~75메가와트의 전기를 생산하도록 설계된 Aurora Powerhouse를 제공합니다. 또한, 사용후 핵연료를 원자로에 사용 가능한 연료로 전환할 수 있는 핵연료 재활용 및 연료 제조 기술을 상용화하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 AltC Acquisition Corp.로 알려졌으며 2024년 5월에 이름을 Oklo Inc.로 변경했습니다. Oklo Inc.는 2013년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 산타클라라에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":23.187,"mcap":4528180224.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-20.258617,"peg":null,"ps":1474.497,"pb":1.2403445,"ev_ebitda":-8.68,"div":0.0,"beta":1.313,"hi52":115.72,"lo52":18.535},"fin":{"rev":3071000.0,"rev_g":null,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.41062,"op":-85.870735,"net":0.0,"roe":-0.0679,"fcf":-552209152.0,"cash":2501829120.0,"debt":4409000.0,"de":0.121,"eps":-0.96,"feps":-1.14455},"own":{"short":0.2188,"inst":0.4578,"insider":0.14579001},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":55.57143,"median":59.0,"high":100.0,"low":14.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.12,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":9,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":10,"hold":9,"sell":0,"